{
  "about": "Reengineer step 16: every guard, router and classifier ships with its replay or sealed eval. tools/decision_evals.py finds them (see its docstring), counts a hook with a `# gate:` header as replayed by tests/test_hookd_replay.py, and reads the rest from evals below. grandfathered is what main held on 2026-10-12 with neither; it only shrinks.",
